  '{"subtype":"comprehension","audioText":"Hi everyone. Today we discuss Renting a Flat. We should book the tickets today because prices rise tomorrow morning. Also, check your passport and arrive early at the station. Focus on reasons and next steps.","transcript":"Hi everyone. Today we discuss Renting a Flat. We should book the tickets today because prices rise tomorrow morning. Also, check your passport and arrive early at the station. Focus on reasons and next steps.","questions":[{"question":"What topic is discussed today?","options":["Cooking desserts","Renting a Flat","Football tactics","Garden insects","Piano tuning","Deep-sea diving"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"The speaker says they discuss “Renting a Flat”."},{"question":"When should tickets be booked?","options":["Today","Next month","In two years","Never","Yesterday only","After the trip"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"“We should book the tickets today…”"},{"question":"Why book today?","options":["The station closes forever","Passports expire tonight","Prices rise tomorrow morning","There is free food tomorrow","Trains stop running forever","The weather becomes perfect"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Prices rise tomorrow morning."},{"question":"What document should you check?","options":["Your school report","Your gym card","Your library book","Your passport","Your shopping list","Your Wi-Fi password"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"“Also, check your passport…”"},{"question":"Where should you arrive early?","options":["At the cinema","At the beach","At the gym","At a café only","At the office cafeteria","At the station"],"correctIndex":5,"explanation":"“…arrive early at the station.”"},{"question":"What should you focus on while listening?","options":["Only background noise","Only the speaker’s shoes","Ignoring advice","Memorizing every comma","Reasons and next steps","The color of the tickets"],"correctIndex":4,"explanation":"“Focus on reasons and next steps.”"},{"question":"How does the speaker greet the audience?","options":["Dear customer","Hi everyone","Breaking news","Good night all","Emergency alert","Class dismissed"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"It opens “Hi everyone.”"},{"question":"When do prices rise?","options":["Tonight at midnight","In one hour","Tomorrow morning","Next winter","In ten years","They never rise"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Prices rise tomorrow morning."},{"question":"Is arriving late recommended?","options":["No — arrive early","Yes — arrive late","Arrive whenever you like","Skip the station","Stay home instead","The time does not matter"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"You should arrive early at the station."},{"question":"What action pairs with checking the passport?","options":["Deleting the booking","Changing the destination randomly","Ignoring prices","Booking tickets and arriving early","Leaving the passport at home","Waiting until prices rise"],"correctIndex":3}]}'::jsonb,
