  'Note the main argument and supporting examples before you answer.',
  '{"subtype":"comprehension","audioText":"Welcome to this B2 listening on University Open Day. The speaker discusses remote collaboration, measurable outcomes, and clear communication. Note the main argument and supporting examples before you answer.","transcript":"Welcome to this B2 listening on University Open Day. The speaker discusses remote collaboration, measurable outcomes, and clear communication. Note the main argument and supporting examples before you answer.","questions":[{"question":"Which listening title is announced?","options":["Market Crash Special","Sports Final","University Open Day","Weather Alert","Cooking Live","Traffic Update"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"It is introduced as a B2 listening on “University Open Day”."},{"question":"Which theme does the speaker discuss first among the listed topics?","options":["Remote collaboration","Local farming","Classical music theory","Fashion trends","Ocean pollution only","Hotel breakfast menus"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"The speaker discusses remote collaboration, measurable outcomes, and clear communication."},{"question":"Besides remote collaboration, what else is discussed?","options":["Holiday decorations","Measurable outcomes and clear communication","Pet training tips","Street food prices","Airport lounges only","Sports betting rules"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":"Those three themes are named together."},{"question":"What should you note before answering?","options":["Only the background music","The speaker’s clothing","A shopping receipt","Irrelevant side jokes only","The main argument and supporting examples","The room temperature"],"correctIndex":4,"explanation":"“Note the main argument and supporting examples before you answer.”"},{"question":"What level is this listening labeled as?","options":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C2 only","Beginner kids"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"It is introduced as a B2 listening."},{"question":"Is “clear communication” mentioned?","options":["No","Only